==Enemy==
This Metal enemy moves slowly. Although it does have a fast attack rate, it has extremely low health and damage, so it is relatively easy to deal with.

==Strategy==
In all of its appearances, this enemy is almost harmless. A critical hitter like [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] is enough to kill it. Failing that, units with with fast attack rates will also do the job.

